but it's buried and I throw a bomb on it.

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:18.303
You know?

00:10:18.303 --> 00:10:19.136
(Audience Laughs)

00:10:19.136 --> 00:10:22.260
This is, this is, for everybody in here

00:10:22.260 --> 00:10:25.610
who's nowhere close or not
at where they want to be.

00:10:25.610 --> 00:10:30.350
It is absolutely the most
cost effective way to

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:32.680
start the process to whatever you want;

00:10:32.680 --> 00:10:36.240
it is about producing content,
producing content at scale,

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:37.880
for as many platforms as possible.

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:41.140
So many people in this
room could have all the

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:44.110
things that they wanted
to happen on YouTube

00:10:44.110 --> 00:10:46.150
and on Instagram for the
last three and a half years

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:48.680
and has not happened, actually happen

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:51.390
if they get serious about Tik
Tok for the next six months.

00:10:51.390 --> 00:10:55.510
What is amazing about the
volume model, is the notion

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:58.470
of marketing for the
sake of better marketing.

00:10:58.470 --> 00:11:01.390
So what happens after
you post those 78 is you

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:04.253
start getting quant and qual feedback.

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:08.030
And what you do with
that feedback is you make

00:11:08.030 --> 00:11:10.510
the next decision, which is,
are you going to write more

00:11:10.510 --> 00:11:11.343
about that?

00:11:11.343 --> 00:11:16.343
Or, has there been such a huge
reaction to people's response

00:11:17.020 --> 00:11:20.710
on what 5G actually means
to their day to day,

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:25.110
not just faster and better
battery, but how our entire world

00:11:25.110 --> 00:11:29.650
changes when you create
that speed of information;

00:11:29.650 --> 00:11:32.220
how that actually makes
the autonomous cars real,

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:34.770
how that actually allows
a doctor in Peru to

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:36.830
perform a surgery on somebody in New York,

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:39.023
how that actually,
actually, actually does.

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:42.160
When you see the response,

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:43.580
now all of a sudden
you say: "You know what

00:11:43.580 --> 00:11:47.370
that little three sentences we
said about did you know when

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:49.670
5G is in your life, this happens?".

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:51.120
That's such a big response.

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:56.100
Why don't we now have
our graphic designer make

00:11:56.100 --> 00:12:00.660
an infographic real quick around
five things you don't know

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:05.270
about 5G, and let's post
that at 3:37 PM today.

00:12:05.270 --> 00:12:07.800
And then when that goes
well then you decide why

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:10.120
don't make a quick little
video on our iPhone talking

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:12.010
to Lars in RND.

00:12:12.010 --> 00:12:14.150
He knows a lot about this shit.

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:14.983
Let's go over to him.

00:12:14.983 --> 00:12:16.890
Lars says, and then you just post it.

00:12:16.890 --> 00:12:21.450
Not with what's quality, with
green screen and lighting,

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:24.253
I mean I was powdered before
I came out here right now.

00:12:24.253 --> 00:12:26.900
(Audience Laughs)

00:12:26.900 --> 00:12:30.093
That to me is not the variable
of success of this talk.

00:12:30.093 --> 00:12:31.430
(Audience Laughs)

00:12:31.430 --> 00:12:34.290
That was not going to be the
variable that made this go well

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:35.140
or not.

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:35.990
(Audience Laughs)

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:37.890
It was what I was going to say.

00:12:37.890 --> 00:12:39.640
- YouTube watcher what's up, it's Gary V.

00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:40.780
First of all, thank you so much.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:43.620
I hope you're doing super
well during these times.

00:12:43.620 --> 00:12:45.490
I also wanna ask you:

00:12:45.490 --> 00:12:49.330
please subscribe because my
commitment and exploration

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:51.950
