explode stories, polls

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:54.970
more content, more engagement,
more surprise, and delight.

00:12:54.970 --> 00:12:57.370
This is the time to subscribe.

00:12:57.370 --> 00:12:58.320
I hope you consider it.

00:12:58.320 --> 00:12:59.620
And I hope I see you soon.

